# Dual RBAC (SmartLoad)

Canonical: RenVerse `docs/revamp/150-spec-complete/153_DUAL_RBAC_SUITE_AND_STANDALONE.md`

- **Standalone:** app-local login; **local RBAC only**
- **Suite:** OIDC; map suite floor → default local role; then **local** `can(user, permission)` + tenant scope
- Suite: `entitled ∧ local_can ∧ in_scope` · Standalone: `local_can ∧ in_scope`
- Entitlement is **`hasAddon('smartload')`** — not a core Suite app requirement
- Never auto-grant super-admin from suite · Never replace SmartLoad permission catalog with Identity roles
- Stay scan / dispatch / POD — not full WMS/ERP
